      "text": "cinematic photorealistic film still, present-day small Midwest town, 35mm film grain, pvprsn7 POV prisoner photo, a first-person view looking down at his own body, lying back on a steel slat cot with a gray wool blanket, his legs stretched out on the blanket and his bare feet at the foot of the cot, his bare pale hairy forearms in the foreground resting on his stomach. His wrists locked in polished steel chain handcuffs, the chain padlocked to a worn brown leather waist belt, his bare ankles locked in steel leg irons joined by a short chain. Standing beside the foot of the cot, to the right of his feet, is a Black woman sergeant in her early thirties with dark brown skin and a tall, broad-shouldered athletic build, her long black locs gathered at the nape. She wears the Graystone County Sheriff's uniform: a crisp, pressed tan long-sleeved uniform shirt of heavy cotton twill with a pointed collar, a full button-front placket, two buttoned flap chest pockets piped in vivid azure blue, shoulder epaulets edged in vivid azure blue, an embroidered vivid azure blue and gold patch on each upper sleeve with three vivid azure blue chevrons beneath it and a polished gold six-point star badge pinned over the left pocket; a vivid, saturated azure blue necktie with a small gold tie bar; tan riding breeches, the same khaki tan as her shirt, with a vivid azure blue stripe down the outer seam; a black leather duty belt with a polished brass buckle; black leather duty gloves; and mirror-polished black leather thigh-high riding boots pulled up over the breeches to mid-thigh; her head is bare. She holds her right arm out toward the lens, an empty small stainless steel chastity cage fitting in her black-gloved palm, raised beside her face, and looks down at him with cool, controlled amusement: one eyebrow raised, her lips pressed in a thin line. Past his feet and around her, the worn gray flagstones of Cell Three, the black iron bars of the cell door and a wall of pale limestone ashlar blocks. A single caged incandescent bulb above throws warm light across her shoulders, the polished steel in her hand and his forearms. Palette of inmate orange, uniform tan, vivid azure blue, polished steel and limestone gray; natural skin texture, 35 mm lens.",
